<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Clinic Doctor | People-Centered Process Improvement</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --accent-red: #E63946;
            --warm-red: #F25C54;
            --deep-black: #0A0A0A;
            --off-black: #1A1A1A;
            --pure-white: #FFFFFF;
            --off-white: #F8F8F8;
            --light-gray: #E0E0E0;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--pure-white);
            color: var(--deep-black);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Cocomat font simulation with weighted Inter */
        .cocomat {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        }

        .mono {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 1.5rem 4rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--light-gray);
            animation: slideDown 0.6s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes slideDown {
            from {
                transform: translateY(-100%);
                opacity: 0;
            }
            to {
                transform: translateY(0);
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            color: var(--deep-black);
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--accent-red);
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2.5rem;
            list-style: none;
        }

        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--deep-black);
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            position: relative;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-red);
        }

        nav a::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -4px;
            left: 0;
            width: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--accent-red);
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }

        nav a:hover::after {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .cta-button {
            background: var(--accent-red);
            color: var(--pure-white);
            padding: 0.75rem 1.8rem;
            border-radius: 0;
            border: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            background: var(--deep-black);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.3);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 8rem 4rem 4rem;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            right: 0;
            width: 50%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--off-white) 0%, var(--pure-white) 100%);
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
            gap: 6rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .hero-text {
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out 0.2s both;
        }

        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .eyebrow {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--accent-red);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 4.5rem;
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        }

        .hero h1 .highlight {
            color: var(--accent-red);
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .primary-btn {
            background: var(--accent-red);
            color: var(--pure-white);
            padding: 1.1rem 2.5rem;
            border: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .primary-btn::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: -100%;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: var(--deep-black);
            transition: left 0.3s ease;
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .primary-btn:hover::before {
            left: 0;
        }

        .primary-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.3);
        }

        .secondary-btn {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--deep-black);
            padding: 1.1rem 2.5rem;
            border: 2px solid var(--deep-black);
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .secondary-btn:hover {
            background: var(--deep-black);
            color: var(--pure-white);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .hero-visual {
            position: relative;
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out 0.4s both;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        .stat-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .stat-card {
            background: var(--pure-white);
            padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--light-gray);
            position: relative;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .stat-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 4px;
            height: 100%;
            background: var(--accent-red);
            transform: scaleY(0);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .stat-card:hover::before {
            transform: scaleY(1);
        }

        .stat-card:hover {
            transform: translateX(8px);
            border-color: var(--accent-red);
        }

        .stat-number {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent-red);
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #666;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        }

        /* Services Section */
        .services {
            padding: 8rem 4rem;
            background: var(--off-black);
            color: var(--pure-white);
            position: relative;
        }

        .section-header {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto 5rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }

        .section-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #999;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .services-grid {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .service-card:nth-child(7) {
            grid-column: auto;
        }

        .service-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            padding: 2.5rem 3rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .service-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 3px;
            background: var(--accent-red);
            transform: scaleX(0);
            transition: transform 0.4s ease;
        }

        .service-card:hover::before {
            transform: scaleX(1);
        }

        .service-card:hover {
            background: rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.05);
            border-color: var(--accent-red);
            transform: translateX(8px);
        }

        .service-icon {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--accent-red);
            font-weight: 500;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            min-width: 60px;
        }

        .service-content {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .service-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .service-card p {
            color: #ccc;
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        /* Process Section */
        .process {
            padding: 8rem 4rem;
            background: var(--pure-white);
        }

        .process-container {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .process-steps {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 3rem;
            margin-top: 5rem;
        }

        .step {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 2rem;
        }

        .step::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 0;
            width: 3px;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--accent-red), transparent);
        }

        .step-number {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: var(--accent-red);
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            opacity: 0.3;
        }

        .step h3 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .step p {
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .step:hover .step-number {
            opacity: 1;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
        }

        /* Testimonial Section */
        .testimonials {
            padding: 8rem 4rem;
            background: var(--off-white);
        }

        .testimonials-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .testimonial-card {
            background: var(--pure-white);
            padding: 4rem;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-red);
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        .quote {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--deep-black);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .author {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .author-info h4 {
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }

        .author-info p {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #666;
        }

        /* CTA Section */
        .cta-section {
            padding: 8rem 4rem;
            background: var(--deep-black);
            color: var(--pure-white);
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .cta-section::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            right: -20%;
            width: 80%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
            animation: pulse 8s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: scale(1);
                opacity: 0.5;
            }
            50% {
                transform: scale(1.1);
                opacity: 0.8;
            }
        }

        .cta-content {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .cta-section h2 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }

        .cta-section p {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            color: #ccc;
        }

        .cta-section .primary-btn {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            padding: 1.2rem 3rem;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background: var(--off-black);
            color: var(--pure-white);
            padding: 4rem 4rem 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .footer-content {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .footer-brand h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .footer-brand p {
            color: #999;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .footer-links h4 {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .footer-links ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .footer-links li {
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: #999;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-red);
        }

        .footer-bottom {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding-top: 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .footer-bottom p {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #666;
        }

        .social-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .social-links a {
            color: #999;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .social-links a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-red);
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .hero-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 3rem;
            }

            .services-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .process-steps {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }

            .footer-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            nav {
                padding: 1rem 2rem;
            }

            nav ul {
                display: none;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 6rem 2rem 3rem;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }

            .section-title {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }

            .process-steps {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .services,
            .process,
            .testimonials,
            .cta-section {
                padding: 4rem 2rem;
            }

            footer {
                padding: 3rem 2rem 1.5rem;
            }

            .footer-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 2rem;
            }

            .footer-bottom {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav>
        <div class="logo">The Clinic <span>Doctor</span></div>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
            <li><a href="#process">Process</a></li>
            <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
        <button class="cta-button">Schedule Consultation</button>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="hero-text">
                <div class="eyebrow">Process Improvement Consulting</div>
                <h1>
                    Transform Your<br>
                    <span class="highlight">People & Processes</span>
                </h1>
                <p>
                    We're The Clinic Doctor, a people-centered consulting firm dedicated to advancing workforce culture and health equity. 
                    We diagnose systemic challenges, design inclusive solutions, and partner with you to build sustainable, equitable practices.
                </p>
                <div class="hero-buttons">
                    <button class="primary-btn">Get Started</button>
                    <button class="secondary-btn">Learn More</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-visual">
                <div class="stat-grid">
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-number">95%</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Client Satisfaction</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-number">100%</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Dedicated to Equity</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-number">12K</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Hours Saved</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-number">3x</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Efficiency Gains</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services" id="services">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2 class="section-title">Our Services</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">
                Comprehensive solutions designed to advance workforce culture and health equity while centering people in every decision.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="services-grid">
            <div class="service-card">
                <div class="service-icon">[01]</div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h3>Strategic Planning</h3>
                    <p>
                        Collaborative sessions that align your equity and culture goals with actionable strategies, creating roadmaps for meaningful organizational transformation.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-card">
                <div class="service-icon">[02]</div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h3>Training & Development</h3>
                    <p>
                        Evidence-based training programs that build cultural competency, strengthen equity practices, and empower teams to create inclusive environments.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-card">
                <div class="service-icon">[03]</div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h3>Speaking Engagements</h3>
                    <p>
                        Thought-provoking presentations and keynotes that inspire action, share best practices, and elevate conversations around health equity and workforce culture.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-card">
                <div class="service-icon">[04]</div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h3>Process Diagnosis</h3>
                    <p>
                        Deep-dive assessments that uncover systemic barriers, inequities in care delivery, and opportunities to redesign processes for better outcomes.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-card">
                <div class="service-icon">[05]</div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h3>Workflow Design & Optimization</h3>
                    <p>
                        Redesign workflows that eliminate disparities, reduce burden on staff, and create equitable experiences for both teams and the communities you serve.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-card">
                <div class="service-icon">[06]</div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h3>Data Analysis</h3>
                    <p>
                        Outsourced analytics that reveal health disparities, measure equity outcomes, and transform data into actionable insights for decision-making.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-card">
                <div class="service-icon">[07]</div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h3>Fractional Team Members</h3>
                    <p>
                        Embedded experts who join your health equity or culture teams part-time, providing specialized expertise without full-time overhead.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="process" id="process">
        <div class="process-container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2 class="section-title">Our Process</h2>
                <p class="section-subtitle">
                    A proven methodology that puts people first and delivers measurable results.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="process-steps">
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">01</div>
                    <h3>Listen & Learn</h3>
                    <p>
                        We immerse ourselves in your environment, listening to staff at all levels to understand pain points and aspirations.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">02</div>
                    <h3>Diagnose & Design</h3>
                    <p>
                        Using data and insights, we identify root causes and co-create solutions with your team.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">03</div>
                    <h3>Implement & Train</h3>
                    <p>
                        We guide implementation with hands-on support, ensuring your team has the tools and knowledge to succeed.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">04</div>
                    <h3>Measure & Sustain</h3>
                    <p>
                        Track outcomes, celebrate wins, and establish systems for continuous improvement long after our engagement ends.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="testimonials">
        <div class="testimonials-container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2 class="section-title">What Our Partners Say</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial-card">
                <p class="quote">
                    "The Clinic Doctor didn't just help us create a health equity strategy—they transformed how we think about culture. By centering our staff and community voices, 
                    they helped us build practices that people believe in. Our equity metrics improved dramatically, and our workforce has never been more engaged."
                </p>
                <div class="author">
                    <div class="author-info">
                        <h4>Dr. Sarah Mitchell</h4>
                        <p>Chief Equity Officer, Regional Health System</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section" id="contact">
        <div class="cta-content">
            <h2>Ready to Advance Equity & Culture?</h2>
            <p>
                Let's diagnose your challenges and design solutions that center equity, strengthen culture, and transform your organization.
            </p>
            <button class="primary-btn">Schedule a Free Consultation</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <div class="footer-content">
            <div class="footer-brand">
                <h3>The Clinic Doctor</h3>
                <p>
                    People-centered consulting for healthcare organizations committed to advancing workforce culture and health equity.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-links">
                <h4>Services</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#services">Strategic Planning</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#services">Training & Development</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#services">Speaking Engagements</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#services">Data Analysis</a></li>
